@startuml
title A confidential depositor's exit against a collateral markdown
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Bad news about a collateral;<<#F3EEFB>>
if (Market priced by an issuer NAV?) then (yes)
  :Markdown lands in one transaction;<<#FDEEEE>>
  if (Exit chosen?) then (batch)
    :Settles at the next dispatch, after the markdown;<<#FDEEEE>>
    :Bears the loss pro rata;
  else (instant)
    :Unwrap cShare, one decryption;<<#F3EEFB>>
    :Redeem from free liquidity, amount public;
  endif
else (no)
  :Price moves over time;<<#F3EEFB>>
  :Compare next dispatch time with the expected move;
endif
if (Zama decryption halted?) then (yes)
  :Neither exit completes until it resumes;<<#FDEEEE>>
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
